# No API key needed — this project runs fully offline against a local
# Ollama server. On Apple Silicon (M-series), Ollama uses Metal GPU
# acceleration automatically — no extra setup needed for that.
#
# 1. Install Ollama: https://ollama.com/download (Mac app, or `brew install ollama`)
# 2. Pull a tool-calling-capable model that fits 16GB unified memory:
#      ollama pull qwen2.5:7b
# 3. Ollama's Mac app runs the server in the background automatically.
#    If you installed via brew instead, start it with `ollama serve`.
#
# Only override these if your setup differs from the defaults:
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
# OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5:7b
